  lines:
  - speaker: Marlo
    portrait: {fileID: 5496424915399974395, guid: 07b2589218cdd3147bc544ac1e97088a, type: 3}
    text: Keep eating the little ones to grow, and gather the pearls. Each one brings
      a ruin closer to waking.
  - speaker: Marlo
    portrait: {fileID: 5496424915399974395, guid: 07b2589218cdd3147bc544ac1e97088a, type: 3}
    text: When you are big enough, the Open Water is waiting beyond this reef. Swim
      bravely, little tang.
